      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.27,
          "en": "So now we achieved quite a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.27,
          "end": 7.72,
          "en": "and we have this basic navigation going on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.72,
          "end": 8.553,
          "en": "Now of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.553,
          "end": 12.16,
          "en": "we're missing the details page when we tap a single meal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.16,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "but before we implement this feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "let's talk about the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "the default styling we get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 22.35,
          "en": "the default title we get here in the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.35,
          "end": 25.71,
          "en": "and how we can change those defaults,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 30.11,
          "en": "because whilst it is nice to get these default settings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.11,
          "end": 34.69,
          "en": "we do get a good looking shell for our content after all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.69,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "we might want to fine tune the settings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 39.01,
          "en": "we might want to change the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.01,
          "end": 43.49,
          "en": "we might want to change the color of this header and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.49,
          "end": 44.323,
          "en": "And of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.323,
          "end": 48.09,
          "en": "all these things can be configured and changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.09,
          "end": 50.583,
          "en": "but where can we change things?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.44,
          "end": 53.79,
          "en": "Well, here in AppJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.79,
          "end": 58.74,
          "en": "or in whichever place you define your screen set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.74,
          "end": 61.1,
          "en": "your screen configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.1,
          "end": 63.96,
          "en": "Here where we have the navigator and its screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.96,
          "end": 66.34,
          "en": "here we can configure it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.34,
          "end": 68.53,
          "en": "And there are a couple of different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.53,
          "end": 70,
          "en": "of configuring things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70,
          "end": 72.5,
          "en": "and I wanna show you all of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.5,
          "end": 76.22,
          "en": "And for this, let's start with this first screen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.22,
          "end": 77.57300000000001,
          "en": "Meals categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 80.02,
          "en": "We got a title here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.02,
          "end": 80.95,
          "en": "And as you can tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.95,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "this title here which we have here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 86.64,
          "en": "is the end simply that name which we assign here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 89.15,
          "en": "Now, the idea behind this name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.15,
          "end": 92.93,
          "en": "really just is that we can navigate between screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.93,
          "end": 96.17,
          "en": "so that we can go to meals overview, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.17,
          "end": 99.12,
          "en": "by navigating to it by its name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.12,
          "end": 101.85300000000001,
          "en": "That's the primary idea behind these names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.88,
          "end": 105.82,
          "en": "Now, React Navigation also uses these names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.82,
          "end": 109.15,
          "en": "as default header titles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.15,
          "end": 111.36,
          "en": "And of course, we could use names here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 114.52000000000001,
          "en": "which make up for good header titles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.52000000000001,
          "end": 118.703,
          "en": "but often you want to have a different title than name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.71000000000001,
          "end": 121.75,
          "en": "And for this you can add another prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.75,
          "end": 124.2,
          "en": "to your screen component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.2,
          "end": 126.593,
          "en": "and that's the options prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.93,
          "end": 131.62,
          "en": "Options wants a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.62,
          "end": 133.84,
          "en": "hence these inner curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.84,
          "end": 136.923,
          "en": "And then there are a ton of options we can set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.78,
          "end": 139.36,
          "en": "You get auto completion here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.36,
          "end": 142.89,
          "en": "which makes setting options easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.89,
          "end": 143.723,
          "en": "But in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.723,
          "end": 147.32,
          "en": "I can only recommend that you dive into the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.32,
          "end": 152.26,
          "en": "There if you go to API reference Navigator's Native Stack,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.26,
          "end": 154.763,
          "en": "you learn about all the options you can set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 156.81,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 161.42000000000002,
          "en": "you learn that there is a title option you can set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.42000000000002,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "but there also are many other options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 166.6,
          "en": "and I can only encourage you to take a detailed look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.6,
          "end": 169.51,
          "en": "at these options if you wanna achieve a certain look,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.51,
          "end": 172.67000000000002,
          "en": "and to simply play around with them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.67000000000002,
          "end": 174.41,
          "en": "Now here we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.41,
          "end": 179.41,
          "en": "set the title option to set the title two meals categories,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.82,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "or all categories, or whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 187.46,
          "en": "And as soon as you do that and you save everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.46,
          "end": 190.06,
          "en": "this title is updated here in the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.06,
          "end": 192.173,
          "en": "So that's how you can configure this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.46,
          "end": 195.89,
          "en": "Of course, you are not limited to the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.89,
          "end": 198.12,
          "en": "What if you want to change colors?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.12,
          "end": 200.34,
          "en": "Of course, that's possible as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.34,
          "end": 204.12,
          "en": "We could go here where we just set the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.12,
          "end": 208.963,
          "en": "and also add our header style option here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.28,
          "end": 214.263,
          "en": "Again, the official docs tell us that this option exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.65,
          "end": 217.6,
          "en": "Now header style wants an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.6,
          "end": 221.11,
          "en": "where you can set various header styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.11,
          "end": 223.09,
          "en": "or to be precise at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 223.09,
          "end": 225.07,
          "en": "at the point of time I'm recording this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 225.07,
          "end": 228.5,
          "en": "there's only one style you can set the background color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 228.5,
          "end": 230.863,
          "en": "which is the style I do wanna set though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232,
          "end": 234.53,
          "en": "And then you can choose any color you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.53,
          "end": 237.12,
          "en": "Here I'll use this extension which I have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.12,
          "end": 239.74,
          "en": "which gives me a file picker here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.74,
          "end": 243.83,
          "en": "to pick a nice brownish color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.83,
          "end": 246.02,
          "en": "maybe something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.02,
          "end": 249.593,
          "en": "The hex code is 351401.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.66,
          "end": 253.443,
          "en": "If we saved this we get this background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.47,
          "end": 257.5,
          "en": "Now the text is not really readable anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.5,
          "end": 259.25,
          "en": "And therefore we can change this as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.25,
          "end": 264.09,
          "en": "And that would be done with help of the header tint color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 264.09,
          "end": 265.9,
          "en": "Again, the official docs tell us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 265.9,
          "end": 269.112,
          "en": "that this will set the color of the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 269.112,
          "end": 270.97,
          "en": "and also off the back button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.97,
          "end": 273.49,
          "en": "and the back button text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.49,
          "end": 275.173,
          "en": "Here I'll set this to white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 276.94,
          "end": 279.033,
          "en": "And with that, this is readable again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 280.13,
          "end": 283.8,
          "en": "Now what about the background behind this grid?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 283.8,
          "end": 288.02,
          "en": "We actually did set a background color before in app.json,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.02,
          "end": 290.73,
          "en": "but this seems to have no effect anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.73,
          "end": 293.64,
          "en": "now that we added React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.64,
          "end": 296.68,
          "en": "Indeed if you wanna change the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 296.68,
          "end": 300.42,
          "en": "of this default background which is provided to us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 300.42,
          "end": 302.633,
          "en": "we can again set another option here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 303.49,
          "end": 305.853,
          "en": "And that would be the content style option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 306.72,
          "end": 309.69,
          "en": "Here we also pass an object as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 309.69,
          "end": 313.15,
          "en": "and we can set all kinds of styling related options here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 313.15,
          "end": 315.47,
          "en": "including the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 315.47,
          "end": 318.193,
          "en": "now for the main screen content though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 319.24,
          "end": 321.39,
          "en": "And that could be any color of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 321.39,
          "end": 324.37,
          "en": "Here I'll pick that brown as a starting point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.37,
          "end": 329.37,
          "en": "and then pick like a light brown grayish background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 330.64,
          "end": 334.233,
          "en": "In this case, it's the hex code 3f2f25.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.33,
          "end": 337.823,
          "en": "Now with data free saved as that's my background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 338.78,
          "end": 340.88,
          "en": "Now, of course, pick any colors you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.88,
          "end": 343.14,
          "en": "but this is how you can set them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 343.14,
          "end": 346.09000000000003,
          "en": "What you'll notice though is that if you now navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 346.09000000000003,
          "end": 349.61,
          "en": "to a different page these settings are lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 349.61,
          "end": 352.31,
          "en": "There is a nice transition between the colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 352.31,
          "end": 354.96,
          "en": "but still we're losing the colors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 354.96,
          "end": 358.31,
          "en": "This is actually not a bug but happening on purpose,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 358.31,
          "end": 359.76,
          "en": "because you could have an app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 359.76,
          "end": 363.69,
          "en": "where you do want different styles for different screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 363.69,
          "end": 365.383,
          "en": "That could be something you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 366.33,
          "end": 369.23,
          "en": "Here it's not something I want though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 369.23,
          "end": 370.34,
          "en": "Now to fix this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 370.34,
          "end": 373.253,
          "en": "we could copy these options to the other screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 374.35,
          "end": 375.39,
          "en": "That would work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 375.39,
          "end": 376.69,
          "en": "but if we have a lot of screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 376.69,
          "end": 380.21,
          "en": "that a lot of copy and pasting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 380.21,
          "end": 383.01,
          "en": "It also means that if we ever change a setting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 383.01,
          "end": 384.59,
          "en": "if we change the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 384.59,
          "end": 386.25,
          "en": "of the header, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 386.25,
          "end": 388.723,
          "en": "we have to change it in multiple places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 389.88,
          "end": 390.75,
          "en": "Therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 390.75,
          "end": 393.11,
          "en": "React Navigation also gives us a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 393.11,
          "end": 396.72,
          "en": "of setting default screen options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 396.72,
          "end": 399.72,
          "en": "Instead of setting options on the individual screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 399.72,
          "end": 401.39,
